{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0079799c0be57a28a87a3a18175e37ab38152fa9e35b561b7da75feea8ce81f0", "ja": "（美希がプリンセスとして出演したテーマパークの\nパレードが、かなりの評判になっている！）", "zh": "（美希打扮成公主参加的\n主题乐园游行大获好评！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "59c8c3180de70b1a9d0ad3e8d64e0ec1986d46b8260d3208540c159bbb29ad1f", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}。\nパレードのミキの特集、もう見てくれた？", "zh": "欸欸，{$P$}。\n你看过美希的游行特辑了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1002_p", "source_sha256": "700d5e6027cdb94f0cd7ac035b585034d431229278c419fd7fdb21b0adf819e0", "ja": "ん？　ああ、雑誌のなら見たよ。イルミネーションに\n囲まれた美希のお姫様、とっても可愛く写ってたぞ。", "zh": "嗯？喔，杂志的特辑我看过了。\n美希在灯饰环绕下的公主扮装，拍得非常可爱喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "16a73ce2f2adeede05529a6745766dcd2bd36392e1e44111e6363d8987e07228", "ja": "でしょでしょ♪　ミキもあの写真、\nすっごく気に入っちゃった☆", "zh": "对吧对吧♪\n美希也很喜欢那张照片☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1004_003mik", "source_sha256": "2b6a7d4cf5e96b80840a18457f6192ce68cfe1e1fd2601e88c25aeed60404943", "ja": "それでね、ああいうのをいっぱい撮ってもらえるように\nもっといい特集を考えてみたの！　聞いて聞いて♪", "zh": "然后啊，美希想到一个更棒的特辑，\n可以拍出好多一样可爱的照片喔！要不要听、要不要听♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1005_p", "source_sha256": "16da22e47b3dab005c9f86e4dcba0ad67ebae0f284e99f64c893108e6a6e3a74", "ja": "おっ、すごいじゃないか。\nどんな特集なんだ？", "zh": "喔！美希真了不起呢。\n是什么特辑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1006_003mik", "source_sha256": "10d50be2c9c4cb22a1f688e6b0475dc0b8e89d419719d3793914851a575391e5", "ja": "あのね、お昼寝特集！", "zh": "就是啊，睡午觉特辑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5d44e935fe3b1dca70bb798da0a9dd409b0bf8a13a131c5dd412f8843d833399", "ja": "……お昼寝？", "zh": "……睡午觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "b7808d195c3e1f2b576506dfe21fee48f4632366463db98201fbff4ceb9e2841", "ja": "うん！　あのテーマパークに、ベッドがあったでしょ？\nミキ、すっごく気にいっちゃった♪", "zh": "嗯！那座主题乐园里不是有床吗？\n美希好喜欢那张床♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7f360fd58447f9f0d6a04acf12c71834322d2e3c3b86b3a0ee4928f66113a535", "ja": "ああ、美希が突然昼寝し始めたベッドのことか……。\nまあ、あのおかげで夜まで頑張れた気もするけど。", "zh": "喔，就是美希突然在上头睡起午觉的那张床吗……？\n不过你能撑到晚上，或许是托了那张床的福呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "aa3f4539ab0712551bb7425731509c83c950e444d926625ad63fb07fa9139242", "ja": "でしょでしょ？　だからあんな風に、ミキが色んな\n場所に行って、色んなベッドと枕でお昼寝するの！", "zh": "对吧对吧？所以就像那样，让美希去许多地方，\n在各式各样的床和枕头上睡午觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1011_003mik", "source_sha256": "b61347e1fcef98e3495f7414ee629658496a642429c2c0fdc7e72c3392ab14f1", "ja": "そこをカメラでパシャリってすれば、\nいい写真、たくさん撮れるって思うな☆", "zh": "接着再用相机喀嚓几下，\n应该就能拍出很多很棒的照片吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "c590cf9758c91e0d733931507f8c69927c22bd20c131759c32dce8d587134d62", "ja": "じゃあ{$P$}、よろしくね♪\nミキ、楽しみにしてる☆", "zh": "那么{$P$}，麻烦你啰♪\n美希很期待喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1013_p", "source_sha256": "3a3ede67bc3bb6b2cab3390dce5f6ad89f994170d4a87c51a03921b1104794da", "ja": "ま、待て待て！　……ええと、\nただ寝てるだけの企画は、難しいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "等、等一下等一下！呃……\n企划内容就只有睡觉，这样可能有点勉强喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "d5fe097126b7690b66e20cc4c8a275e717fa7e66e0eae81bb3b602ce72cde6ac", "ja": "……難しいの？　むー。\nミキ的には、最高の企画だって思うけど……。", "zh": "……会吗？唔～\n但美希觉得这个企划超棒耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ed7747f64ccb89089bc9aab8ad427d3fbb893b9e4507c34fe1c0050d4eaeedd1", "ja": "寝るだけじゃなくて……たとえば、\nおススメのお昼寝グッズを紹介するとか……。", "zh": "可以不要只是睡觉……比方说，\n介绍你推荐的午睡小物之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "03d6a94cef26b84d1b00ff3dc90eeee1be429d359adcb3ee5985964b98575de8", "ja": "それで決まりなの！\nお昼寝グッズ、一緒に見に行こうね☆", "zh": "就这么办！\n我们一起去看有哪些午睡小物可以推荐吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1017_p", "source_sha256": "22254282de514c2eddd90227e6040dab63eb5c0eb6655ebc3c9b3c80889d4048", "ja": "即決なのか……。今のはたとえばの話だぞ？\nまあ、もう少し後なら、時間は取れるけど。", "zh": "这么快就决定了……我刚刚只是打个比方啊！\n算了，晚点我应该能空出一些时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1018_003mik", "source_sha256": "092b9d8c2e4d04d62c400aa2ef3d6dd85f5dbfb6fcc8a59849a5fc89bc36ef51", "ja": "じゃあ、それまでミキ、お昼寝して待ってるね。\nおやすみなさいなの……あふぅ。", "zh": "那，美希就边睡午觉边等你啰。\n晚安唷……啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1019_p", "source_sha256": "1bc4475ab32699c70457c32a46e39831347a596266cda82421bc000f4c0fabfe", "ja": "あ、おい、美希……。", "zh": "啊、喂，美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1020_p", "source_sha256": "838ea750653c2e69367d4e3738ce5de87bd42cda984848b0fe12571ebc2bdcc2", "ja": "（あっと言う間に寝てしまった……。\nけど、たしかにかわいい寝顔だ……）", "zh": "（一眨眼就睡着了……\n不过，她的睡脸的确非常可爱……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_003mik0073_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_003mik0073_1021_p", "source_sha256": "991acac6fd55bf7127804597b16c5e4ac75304ed60334b78f7f994a87ea01798", "ja": "（……案外、イケる企画なのか？）", "zh": "（……这企划说不定真的可行？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
